CKP sensor and/or its circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Sensor plate
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ECM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph>
P0336: Crankshaft Position Sensor “A” Circuit Range / Performance
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Any of the following conditions is met. 
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Signal detecting time is longer than specification.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Number of teeth between gaps is more than specification.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Time between adjacent two teeth is longer than specification.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
